<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 384-5 V INDIA A - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 384-5 V INDIA A - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>NAGPUR, India 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 384 for five at the close on the first day of a three-day match against India A on Tuesday.</p>
